THE DELIVERY

Vanta delivers his work the same way every time. He writes the script on the screen. Full source. Every line. He doesn't attach files. He doesn't say "check your email." He pulls up the code in his editor, types it out, and turns the monitor toward the client. They copy it themselves. That's the delivery method.

